  "_comment": "Maps Citizen's Charter 'Office or Division' values to a service category and a department slug (src/data/directory/departments.json). 'patterns' are case-insensitive regular expressions tried in order; the first mapping that matches wins. 'exclude' drops back-office services that residents do not transact.",
